{"@context":["https://schema.org",{"emsenn":"https://emsenn.net/vocab#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"}],"@id":"https://emsenn.net/blog/2025-08-02-1939-babble/","@type":"Article","dateModified":"2025-08-02","datePublished":"2025-08-02","description":"I don\u0026rsquo;t have words\nthat would express the love-as-verb,\nbut when I see you how you look at me,\nI know they aren\u0026rsquo;t necessary;\nyou\u0026rsquo;re feeling the same way.\nfuck\ni want to demonstrate the versality\nnot of the word\n","keywords":"babble, poem","name":"Babble, 2025-08-02, 19:39h","publisher":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn","url":"https://emsenn.net"},"url":"https://emsenn.net/blog/2025-08-02-1939-babble/"}